                    Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Poindexter</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-18T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 18,
                                1928—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>3. Your 1, January 17, 4 p.m. Expedition sailing January 19 steamer <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Santa Luisa.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olds</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
